@PaymentsApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5589

### Create a financial account
POST {{PaymentsApp_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "currency": "PLN",
  "principalOriginal": 10000.00,
  "interestAccrued": 250.00,
  "additionalCosts": 100.00,
  "handoverDate": "2026-11-04"
}

### Get account balance
GET {{PaymentsApp_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/balance
Accept: application/json
